{"data": [{"id": "2122127192419430756", "author_id": "1510028300", "text": "@Gorden_Sun 真想试试，不过还得拿自己项目跑一遍才知道误报多不多", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:38:44.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/rainwaterJay/status/2122127192419430756", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122119188294877644", "author_id": "1382131662776008707", "text": "@Gorden_Sun 内部磨了两年这点挺有说服力的。就是好奇放到外面的项目会不会水土不服，毕竟是照着阿里自己那套规范调出来的", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:06:56.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/gggggg57427840/status/2122119188294877644", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122118341917868302", "author_id": "1757615673478660097", "text": "@Gorden_Sun 能按行号写意见，还能接进 Claude Code 或 Codex，这比再包一层“帮我审一下”实用。准确率高不高、能不能省 token，拿自己仓库里漏过的安全问题和逻辑错误试一遍更准。内部拦了多少缺陷是官方口径；合并前能拦住现有流程看走眼的那几处，这工具才算值。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:03:34.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/comaple123/status/2122118341917868302", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122113328512475591", "author_id": "1992952876533215232", "text": "@Gorden_Sun 误报率确实是关键，能接 Claude Code 很方便，但要是每天被假警报淹一次，估计很快就被踢出流程了。先在小仓库试试水。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T23:43:39.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/xiri318695/status/2122113328512475591", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122050709763850276", "author_id": "2004435780631146496", "text": "@Gorden_Sun 数百万缺陷听着唬人，误报率一个字没提\n误报哪怕只有 5%，几百万里也是十几万条假警报\nreview 队列淹掉一次，工具就被踢出流程了\n抓得多不值钱，吵得少才值钱", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T19:34:49.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/himiaocc/status/2122050709763850276", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122023322083033261", "author_id": "1992952876533215232", "text": "@Gorden_Sun 阿里这个开源得挺实在，能接 Claude Code 的话日常 review 就能直接省不少人工。好奇它对中文代码注释的理解怎么样，误报率低才是真的好用。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T17:45:59.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/xiri318695/status/2122023322083033261", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122012810196791765", "author_id": "2083308734525190144", "text": "@Gorden_Sun The number of suggestions is the easy part. The hard part is whether a reviewer can act on each one inside the diff without losing the thread, so tools that cut context switching will win over tools that just produce more comments.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T17:04:13.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/RichChrisDotCom/status/2122012810196791765", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122004607811338699", "author_id": "876814360659623940", "text": "@Gorden_Sun 我这边还是让 Claude 调度不同模型交叉审查，意见收上来自己再过一遍。工具能标到行号当然好，但合不合进去，我还是不敢全交给它。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T16:31:38.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/kaizaoji/status/2122004607811338699", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121984560238141887", "author_id": "2108438560416415744", "text": "@Gorden_Sun 拦下多少缺陷是好看，误报率才决定大家会不会真把它留在流程里", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T15:11:58.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/TedCai233/status/2121984560238141887", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 61, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121964008617943162", "author_id": "415492988", "text": "@Gorden_Sun 能接 Claude Code 和 Codex，等于审查模型和写代码模型可以拆开。想问一下：你实际默认走哪一档？如果第一轮审查换成 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 或 Kimi，漏报会明显变多吗？", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T13:50:18.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/anbulang/status/2121964008617943162", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121960447780044966", "author_id": "2114993211936813056", "text": "@Gorden_Sun 能直接接进 Claude Code 这点挺实用，现在 agent 写得太快了，最缺的就是有人帮着审一遍", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T13:36:09.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/AiMaster1689/status/2121960447780044966", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121959268538515545", "author_id": "1640237294551552000", "text": "@Gorden_Sun 接手陌生仓库时可以先对整个文件夹跑一次体检，拿到按行号列出的修改建议，把安全漏洞和逻辑错误按行号建任务逐个修，修完再走一遍同一次目录级审查作回归，把两次结果的差异当作本次迭代的覆盖清单；通过 API 调用时把目录路径和语言参数固定写死，再接入 Claude Code 或 Codex 的 agent", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T13:31:28.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/zrqgood9068/status/2121959268538515545", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 99, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121958980133982391", "author_id": "2052373733319548929", "text": "@Gorden_Sun 内部磨了两年的东西说开源就开源，阿里这回挺大方，周末接上 Claude Code 试试", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T13:30:19.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/MathisTerr61689/status/2121958980133982391", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121956181409423419", "author_id": "2021555722237206528", "text": "@Gorden_Sun 代码审查工具接进 Claude Code 后，有个实用做法：让写代码和审代码的模型分开，比如 Claude 写、另一个模型审，能少一些“自己审自己”的盲区。想问下 OpenCodeReview 支持自定义审查规则吗？比如团队自己的命名规范和禁用写法，这块对落地最关键。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T13:19:12.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/jiaxintang5065/status/2121956181409423419", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121956045560197164", "author_id": "1769777068462735364", "text": "@Gorden_Sun 内部打磨两年再开源这个点很关键，等于先在自己身上跑通了。能直接对着行号给修改意见、还能接 Claude Code / Codex，比通用 AI 检查工具省 token 的说法也合理——审查这活儿，准比快重要。", "lang": "zh", "created_at": "2026-11-15T13:18:39.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Lazy30512488561/status/2121956045560197164", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1510028300", "username": "rainwaterJay", "name": "星海拾珠", "verified": false}, {"id": "1657474831", "username": "Gorden_Sun", "name": "Gorden Sun", "verified": false}, {"id": "1382131662776008707", "username": "gggggg57427840", "name": "chengzi", "verified": false}, {"id": "1757615673478660097", "username": "comaple123", "name": "comaple zhang", "verified": false}, {"id": "1992952876533215232", "username": "xiri318695", "name": "xiri", "verified": false}, {"id": "2004435780631146496", "username": "himiaocc", "name": "MIAO", "verified": false}, {"id": "2083308734525190144", "username": "RichChrisDotCom", "name": "Rich Chris", "verified": false}, {"id": "876814360659623940", "username": "kaizaoji", "name": "Kaizaoji｜开造记", "verified": false}, {"id": "2108438560416415744", "username": "TedCai233", "name": "Ted Cai", "verified": false}, {"id": "415492988", "username": "anbulang", "name": "Chaucer", "verified": false}, {"id": "2114993211936813056", "username": "AiMaster1689", "name": "AI安装小天才", "verified": false}, {"id": "1640237294551552000", "username": "zrqgood9068", "name": "zrqgood", "verified": false}, {"id": "2052373733319548929", "username": "MathisTerr61689", "name": "Terri Mathis", "verified": false}, {"id": "2021555722237206528", "username": "jiaxintang5065", "name": "Jiaxintang", "verified": false}, {"id": "1769777068462735364", "username": "Lazy30512488561", "name": "Lazy阿洋", "verified": false}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2122127192419430756", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzovrmnclt7ifbicsc96at241szgd", "oldest_id": "2121956045560197164", "result_count": 15}}